382 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 278 0 R
/E (The overarching aim of this project is to develop a secure, user-friendly, and operationally realistic web-based Guesthouse Reservation Platform that improves the efficiency of reservation management and daily property operations. Specific objectives:)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
